 ## Background
-The method was presented by Rautek et al. [S1]. It extends the flexibility and exploration capabilities offered by Rautek et al.'s original semantic-layers system, which used textual rules and fuzzy logic [S1]. The approach builds on the principle that rule-based visualization bears great potential, but formal and textual rule formulations are rigid and non-exploratory [S1]. It differs from UberShader and SuperShader by generating code fragments entirely on the fly rather than combining pre-coded fragments [S1].
